<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia July unemployment unchanged at 13.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia July unemployment unchanged at 13.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p>				    July	   June	  July '95</p>
<p>    percentage		  13.3	   13.3	    13.8</p>
<p>    total		    114,051	113,977	 116,384</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
